UI018 C03 targeted regression evidence
Date: 2026-10-03
Scope: local React demo/Vite and synthetic MSW data only.

Unit tests
Command: node node_modules/vitest/vitest.mjs run --config apps/web/vitest.config.ts apps/web/tests/timezone.test.ts apps/web/tests/report-utils.test.ts
Result on final UI018 source: PASS; 2 test files, 15 tests.
Coverage includes UTC/offset/day boundary, DST start, skipped midnight (America/Sao_Paulo), skipped date (Pacific/Apia), invalid calendar date/timezone, inclusive report end and existing wall-time gap/fold behavior.

