Result: PASS; 22/22 Chromium tests in 56.3s. This covered the full selected FE015, FE021 and UI011 files in local demo mode with synthetic MSW data.
Key UI018 assertions: FE015.AC01 “report filters use exact timezone boundaries and mock API aggregates” PASS; FE021 “export uses inclusive shop-local boundaries, safe CSV, API jobs and cursor pagination” PASS. UI011 report default/month boundary and shipment datetime-local browser-timezone cases PASS.

